  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have peerless skill using a net as a melee weapon.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Net Adept<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you wield a net as a melee weapon you gain a shield bonus to AC as if wearing a buckler (without the armor check penalty or spell-failure chance). Additionally, when you make a successful melee attack with your net you may make an automatic combat maneuver check to trip that opponent.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-n-z-feats#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
